ListItem template goes outright. CLAUDE.md states the rule: element identity in xhtml:, structure in component namespaces, the unnamed mode as the value leaf.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"civitai/civitai","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-08T23:23:43Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"935b37ddaae70b4dd4902e5e40e992c7cfaef72a","github_link":"https://github.com/civitai/civitai/commit/935b37ddaae70b4dd4902e5e40e992c7cfaef72a","commit_subject":"feat(training-studio): gate the app behind a Flipt closed-beta segment","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Dolibarr/dolibarr","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-08T23:23:06Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"1584753c4f5d71e363c6618dbed385f54af275a5","github_link":"https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr/commit/1584753c4f5d71e363c6618dbed385f54af275a5","commit_subject":"NEW Standalone reception: use the supplier-order add-line block and editable line columns (#39295)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"quartznet/quartznet","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-08T23:23:06Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"a96c5e369cfc3254b905c8872b174d7d03e6d15c","github_link":"https://github.com/quartznet/quartznet/commit/a96c5e369cfc3254b905c8872b174d7d03e6d15c","commit_subject":"The trigger-details endpoint refuses a body it cannot read","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"oshaughn/research-projects-RIT","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-08T23:23:03Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"495c054003f458a95a43d4dc030b3b765688fcbb","github_link":"https://github.com/oshaughn/research-projects-RIT/commit/495c054003f458a95a43d4dc030b3b765688fcbb","commit_subject":"jax ILE: give the note one return arity, and pin it","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"tinacms/tinacms","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-08T23:22:33Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"c5407b7f97c922ddace0062a3c8b04d34b921a91","github_link":"https://github.com/tinacms/tinacms/commit/c5407b7f97c922ddace0062a3c8b04d34b921a91","commit_subject":"Replace generic \"Please wait\" loading copy with Tina-branded messaging (#7529)","ai_tool":"Copil